@startuml
title UTrabajo — Despliegue conceptual S14
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Usuario" as U
node "Android" as A
cloud "DNS / TLS
Reverse proxy" as Edge
node "Spring Boot API
Monolito modular" as API
database "PostgreSQL
administrado" as DB
cloud "Object storage
privado" as OS
cloud "Observabilidad
metrics/logs/traces/alerts" as Obs
cloud "Secret manager" as Secrets

U --> A
A --> Edge : HTTPS
Edge --> API : HTTPS
Secrets --> API : secrets
API --> DB : JDBC/TLS
API --> OS : archivos privados
API --> Obs : telemetry
DB --> Obs : health/metrics
Edge --> Obs : access/edge metrics

note bottom of API
Alternativa A:
1 instancia API
Costo relativo 1 D0
end note

note right of Edge
Alternativa B:
agrega load balancer
+ >=2 réplicas API
Costo relativo 2–3 D0
end note
@enduml
